 </span><span class=\"ex\">I went bright <span class=\"rf\">red </span></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd4\"><span class=\"trans\">me puse colorado <span class=\"underline\">or</span> rojo como un tomate</span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd3 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">he has <span class=\"rf\">red</span> hair </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd4\"><span class=\"trans\">es pelirrojo</span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd3 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">the (traffic) lights were <span class=\"rf\">red </span></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd4\"><span class=\"trans\">el semáforo estaba (en) rojo </span></span></span></span><span id=\"e_b-en-es0039938.004\" class=\"semb x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">b </span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"co\"><span class=\"gp tg_co\">‹</span>meat<span class=\"gp tg_co\">› </span></span><span class=\"trans\">rojo </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"co\"><span class=\"gp tg_co\">‹</span>wine<span class=\"gp tg_co\">› </span></span><span class=\"trans\">tinto </span></span></span></span><span id=\"e_b-en-es0039938.005\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"gp sn ty_label tg_semb\">2 </span><span class=\"hvg\"><span class=\"hv\">Red </span></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span class=\"lg\"><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">(</span><span class=\"fld\">Politics</span><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">) </span></span><span d:def=\"1\" class=\"trans\">rojo <d:def></d:def></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">the <span class=\"rf\">Red</span> Army </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">el Ejército Rojo </span></span></span></span></span><span id=\"e_b-en-es0039938.006\" class=\"gramb x_xd0 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"gp sn ty_label tg_gramb\">B </spa