pan></span><span d:def=\"1\" class=\"trans\">power supply<span class=\"gp tg_tr\">, </span><d:def></d:def></span><span class=\"trans\">mains </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span class=\"ind\"><span class=\"gp tg_ind\">(</span>de gas<span class=\"gp tg_ind\">) </span></span><span class=\"trans\">mains </span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">todavía no han conectado el barrio a la <span class=\"rf\">red </span></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">the neighborhood has not been connected up to the mains <span class=\"underline\">or</span> to the power supply yet</span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">antes de conectarlo a la <span class=\"rf\">red </span></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">before connecting it to the mains<span class=\"gp tg_tr\">, </span></span><span class=\"trans\">before connecting it to the house current <span class=\"lg\"><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">(</span><span class=\"reg\">US English</span><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">) </span></span></span></span></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040093.033\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"gp sn ty_label tg_semb\">4 </span><span class=\"frmg\"><span class=\"gp tg_frmg\">(</span><span class=\"frm\">la Red</span><span class=\"gp tg_frmg\">) </span></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span class=\"lg\"><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">(</span><span class=\"fld\">Computing</span><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">) </span></span><span d:def=\"1\" class=\"trans\">the Net <d:def></d:def></span></span></span></span><span class=\"idmb x_xo0\"><span class=\"gp x_xoh x_xoLblBlk ty_label tg_idmb\">IDIOMS </span><span class=\"idmsec x_xo1\"><span class=\"idm x_xoh\">caer en las redes de alguien </span><span class=\"trg x_xo2\"><span class=\"trans\">to fall into somebody's clutches </span></span></span></span></d:entry></body></html>\n",
    "text": "red feminine noun 1 a (para pescar) net b (Sport) net ▸ subir a la red to go up to or go into the net c (para el pelo) hairnet d (en el tren) rack, luggage rack 2 (de comunicaciones, emisoras) network (de comercios, empresas) chain, network ▸ red de carreteras/ferrocarriles network of roads/railways▸ red hotelera hotel chain▸ una red de espionaje/narcotraficantes a spy ring/drug-trafficking ring 3 (de electricidad) power supply, mains (de gas) mains ▸ todavía no han conectado el barrio a la red the neighborhood has not been connected up to the mains or to the power supply yet▸ antes de conectarlo a la red before connecting it to the mains, before connecting it to the house current (US English) 4 (la Red) (Computing) the Net IDIOMS caer en las redes de alguien to fall into somebody's clutches "
  }
